# Phase 15 field-scaffold campaign (C15.3). Pre-registered in
# experiments/phase15-field-preregistration.md BEFORE this file ran; the
# observables, persistence window, thresholds and expectations are fixed
# there. Production total is identical in every condition by
# construction; only its placement varies. Both coupling fractions stay
# zero so organisms and field cannot touch each other and every
# between-condition difference is the production placement's alone.
# Seeds 16001..16032 excluding 16005 and 16009 (30 seeds, disjoint from
# every prior decision range): the campaign's preflight refused those two
# before any world ran - both generate land fractions below the worldgen
# minimum at 64x64 - and the pre-registration records the amendment.
campaign phase15-field-scaffold
ticks 60000
workers 8
seeds 16001..16004 16006..16008 16010..16032
check-interval 5000
base preset phase1
base cells_x 64
base cells_y 64
base initial_organisms 40
base max_entities 4000
base chemistry.enabled true
base chemistry.field_steps_per_tick 1
base chemistry.microbial_enabled true
base chemistry.abiogenesis_enabled true
base chemistry.mutation_q16 4096
condition N
condition S1
condition S2
condition S3
condition S4
set S1 chemistry.scaffold_patch_radius_cells 3
set S1 chemistry.scaffold_patch_contrast_q16 131072
set S2 chemistry.scaffold_patch_radius_cells 3
set S2 chemistry.scaffold_patch_contrast_q16 262144
set S3 chemistry.scaffold_patch_radius_cells 3
set S3 chemistry.scaffold_patch_contrast_q16 524288
set S4 chemistry.scaffold_patch_radius_cells 3
set S4 chemistry.scaffold_patch_contrast_q16 1048576
vary chemistry.scaffold_patch_radius_cells
vary chemistry.scaffold_patch_contrast_q16
output events off
output snapshots on
output field 500
